# Clerk publishable key — this is the ONLY Clerk value a Vite frontend may use.
# Local development: pk_test_... from your Clerk Development instance.
# Production/Vercel: pk_live_... from your Clerk Production instance.
# This value is inlined into the bundle at build time, so it must be present
# BEFORE `npm run build` runs (Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables).
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# NEVER add CLERK_SECRET_KEY here. It is a server-only credential and must not
# be placed in frontend code or in any VITE_* variable.
